  "section": "6.92",
  "rulesText": "A Druidic Focus takes one of the forms in the Druidic Focuses table and is carved, tied with ribbon, or painted to channel primal magic. A Druid or Ranger can use such an object as a Spellcasting Focus.\n\nDruidic Focuses",
